{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KgfSRz7vsYGSCn9ptGegH8","type":"tool_result","content":"`getQueue` is synchronous, not a Promise. The page says \"This method is synchronous.\" Its signature is:\n\n`getQueue<T>(id: string): QueueItem<T> | undefined`\n\n`QueueItem<T>` has these fields:\n\n- `id`: a string that identifies the task\n- `payload`: the data passed to the callback, typed as `T`\n- `callback`: the name of the agent method to call, typed as `keyof Agent`\n- `created_at`: a number recording when the task was created\n- `retry` (optional): retry options for that task"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9ff595ac-be2c-4329-96ac-bbe0521130a9","uuid":"92f915fa-500e-496d-a30e-9bfc1ed2d232","timestamp":"2026-10-08T12:09:52.503Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":14673,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"`getQueue` is synchronous, not a Promise. The page says \"This method is synchronous.\" Its signature is:\n\n`getQueue<T>(id: string): QueueItem<T> | undefined`\n\n`QueueItem<T>` has these fields:\n\n- `id`: a string that identifies the task\n- `payload`: the data passed to the callback, typed as `T`\n- `callback`: the name of the agent method to call, typed as `keyof Agent`\n- `created_at`: a number recording when the task was created\n- `retry` (optional): retry options for that task","durationMs":4212,"url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/api-reference/queue-tasks/"},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01KgfSRz7vsYGSCn9ptGegH8","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
